  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: denial of service via a 0-length UDP packet\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2023-32067.patch: in read_udp_packets() in\n       ares_process.c, treat a 0-length UDP read as a 0-length packet and keep\n       reading instead of tearing the server connection down; only a negative\n       return value is now an error, and an answer from a mismatched address\n       no longer stops the read loop.\n     - CVE-2023-32067",
